@startuml
title Logout - local cleanup and server revocation
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
actor User
participant "Auth workflow" as Auth
participant "Session / HTTP client" as Session
participant "Platform storage" as Storage
participant "Private query cache" as Cache
participant Backend
User -> Auth : Sign out
Auth -> Session : Increment generation; block protected requests
Auth -> Storage : Capture revocation credentials;
Auth -> Storage : mark logout pending
Auth -> Session : Clear token + identity; abort obsolete requests
Auth -> Cache : Cancel queries; remove private data
Auth -> Storage : Delete native stored refresh token
Auth -> Backend : POST /api/auth/sign-out
note over Auth,Backend
Web: existing HttpOnly cookie.
Native: captured credential; proposed contract.
end note
alt server logout succeeds
  Backend -> Backend : Revoke refresh token
  Backend --> Auth : 204; delete web refresh cookie
  Auth -> Storage : Clear pending-logout marker
  Auth --> User : Signed out
else network / server failure
  Backend --> Auth : Failure
  Auth --> User : Locally signed out; server revocation unconfirmed
  note over Auth,Storage
Web cookie may remain: pending logout prevents
automatic bootstrap until retry or explicit login.
Native credentials stay deleted.
end note
end
note over Session,Cache
Late responses from the old generation are ignored.
Already issued JWTs remain valid until expiry.
end note
@enduml
